      "alt": "Starterkit STKa8MxML",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A53 based oni.MX8M Mini</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa8MxML is an evaluation kit for embedded computing engineers. It's based on the TQMa8MxML platform, powered by the Arm Cortex-A53 processor from NXP. This kit offers advanced audio capabilities and includes an integrated Cortex-M4 for versatile processing tasks. High-speed communication is facilitated through 1x Gbit Ethernet, 1x PCIe, and 2x USB 2.0 interfaces. Despite its powerful features, it maintains low power consumption and incorporates integrated security functions for enhanced data protection. Ideal for applications demanding complex graphics and audio processing.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:54:26 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
      "textIsRich": "true",
